+// PROJECT PATCH (T-051): test-only frame attribution.
+//
+// ZH_ATTR_LOG=<csv> writes one row per rendered frame from GameEngine::update/execute with
+// every phase of the frame on the same clock, so the sum of the buckets can be compared with
+// the total interval and the residual ("gap") is visible. GameClient and GameLogic publish
+// their sub-timings here instead of opening their own files, which keeps the whole frame in
+// one aligned row.
+//
+// The globals are written by the owner thread only (the engine's single simulation/render
+// thread); this is diagnostic plumbing, not shared state. All values are milliseconds.
+
+extern double g_zhAttrShellMs;
+extern double g_zhAttrDrawMs;
+extern double g_zhAttrParticlesMs;
+extern double g_zhAttrDisplayStringMs;
+extern double g_zhAttrIngameUiMs;
